# SHADOWSOCKS Account Management Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@apiKey = your_api_key_here

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create SHADOWSOCKS Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shadowsocks/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testss",
  "password": "testpassword",
  "exp": "30",
  "ip_quota": "5"
}

### Check SHADOWSOCKS Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shadowsocks/check
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testss"
}

### Renew SHADOWSOCKS Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shadowsocks/renew
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testss",
  "exp": "15"
}

### Delete SHADOWSOCKS Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shadowsocks/delete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testss"
}

### Create SHADOWSOCKS Account (General Endpoint)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testss2",
  "password": "testpassword",
  "exp": "30",
  "ip_quota": "5",
  "account_type": "shadowsocks"
}

### Check SHADOWSOCKS Account (General Endpoint)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/check
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testss2",
  "account_type": "shadowsocks"
}

### Renew SHADOWSOCKS Account (General Endpoint)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/renew
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testss2",
  "exp": "15",
  "account_type": "shadowsocks"
}

### Delete SHADOWSOCKS Account (General Endpoint)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/delete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testss2",
  "account_type": "shadowsocks"
}